    {"type":"rectangle","id":"p2_fd_invariant","x":100,"y":1325,"width":760,"height":180,"strokeColor":"#1e293b","backgroundColor":"#1e293b","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":1600051,"version":1,"versionNonce":1600052,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"p2_fd_invariant_text","x":125,"y":1345,"width":710,"height":140,"text":"eventfd 不变量 · L2AdapterInterface\n\n每个 adapter 必须返回 3 个不同 fd：\n  get_store_event_fd()\n  get_lookup_and_lock_event_fd()\n  get_load_event_fd()\n并且跨全部 adapters 全局唯一。\n\nController 建立 fd → adapter map；重复 fd 会静默把 completion 路由到错误 adapter。\nLinux 用 os.eventfd；其他平台用 non-blocking pipe。","originalText":"eventfd 不变量 · L2AdapterInterface\n\n每个 adapter 必须返回 3 个不同 fd：\n  get_store_event_fd()\n  get_lookup_and_lock_event_fd()\n  get_load_event_fd()\n并且跨全部 adapters 全局唯一。\n\nController 建立 fd → adapter map；重复 fd 会静默把 completion 路由到错误 adapter。\nLinux 用 os.eventfd；其他平台用 non-blocking pipe。","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#ffffff","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":1600053,"version":1,"versionNonce":1600054,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"rectangle","id":"p2_lock_table","x":900,"y":1325,"width":1595,"height":180,"strokeColor":"#1e3a5f","backgroundColor":"#dbeafe","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":1600055,"version":1,"versionNonce":1600056,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"p2_lock_table_text","x":930,"y":1345,"width":1535,"height":140,"text":"Prefetch 锁状态\nLOOKUP               L1: 已有命中 read-lock              L2: found keys lookup-lock\nPLAN                  L1: reserve temporary write buffers L2: plan keys locked；非 plan 立即 unlock\nLOAD                  L1: write-locked                    L2: plan keys locked\nFINALIZE success      L1: atomic write→read               L2: 全部 unlock\nSERVING RETRIEVE      L1: read-lock 直到 H2D callback      L2: 无\nFAIL / SHUTDOWN       L1: finish/delete/release           L2: unlock all held keys\n\n原则：任何异常路径都必须有对称 unlock；否则不是普通 miss，而是容量/可用性泄漏。","originalText":"Prefetch 锁状态\nLOOKUP               L1: 已有命中 read-lock              L2: found keys lookup-lock\nPLAN                  L1: reserve temporary write buffers L2: plan keys locked；非 plan 立即 unlock\nLOAD                  L1: write-locked                    L2: plan keys locked\nFINALIZE success      L1: atomic write→read               L2: 全部 unlock\nSERVING RETRIEVE      L1: read-lock 直到 H2D callback      L2: 无\nFAIL / SHUTDOWN       L1: finish/delete/release           L2: unlock all held keys\n\n原则：任何异常路径都必须有对称 unlock；否则不是普通 miss，而是容量/可用性泄漏。","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":1600057,"version":1,"versionNonce":1600058,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25}
  ],
  "appState":{"viewBackgroundColor":"#ffffff","gridSize":20},"files":{}
}
